; THE ACCEPTANCE SCENE. No player, no camera in the main window -- the Shots node
; makes its own 4K SubViewport and photographs the world through that. The visible
; window therefore renders nothing but the clear colour and costs nothing, and no
; pixel outside this process is ever read.

